"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d investigate the earlier-arriving Turkish award first: it has the better timing of the two shown award choices. The tradeoff is that it requires a separate SFO–LAX cash ticket before the award, with no confirmed ticket protection.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J63@2027-01-08T08:36-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-10T04:15\",\"n\":\"Earlier-arriving Turkish award\",\"v\":\"This option reports a 275,000-point Turkish business award via Istanbul, plus a separate American SFO–LAX ticket with a 150-minute LAX gap. Its reported award connection at Istanbul is shorter than the alternative’s, and it reaches Bangkok earlier. The award taxes and fees are unknown; the reported $59 positioning fare has unknown price scope, so neither amount can be treated as a per-traveler or all-in cost. The award’s business-cabin label does not establish the cabin on every leg.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T02\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T03\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J115@2027-01-08T08:40-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-10T08:50\",\"n\":\"Later-arriving Turkish alternative\",\"v\":\"This also reports 275,000 Turkish points and a $59 separate Alaska SFO–LAX fare, with a 149-minute LAX gap. It departs just four minutes later, but arrives later and has the longer Istanbul award connection—so investigate it only if that later timing suits you better. Its award taxes and fees and both quotes’ price scopes are unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-08T06:05-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline\",\"v\":\"The search also returned a $452 USD SFO–BKK cash itinerary with two stops, on Delta and Korean Air. Its price scope is unknown, so it is a baseline rather than a like-for-like all-in comparison with either award; the award taxes are unknown and the positioning fares are separate quotes.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The search requested one traveler, but the award traveler support and the price scope of the reported cash amounts are not established. These results may not be real-time; confirm current availability, prices, ticketing arrangements, and whether the separate LAX tickets are workable before booking. Search coverage was partial, so this comparison does not cover every possible option.\"}]}"
